 **要求**：**逐字精确**地提取海报上应出现的所有文字（标题、标语、日期等）。\n*   **重要**：保留原始的大小写和标点符号。若用户未提供具体文案，可根据主题合理创作，但必须在提示词中明确指出文字内容。\n\n### Dimension 4: Text Style and Position (文本样式与位置)\n*   **目标**：设计排版细节。\n*   **要求**：\n    *   **字体**：描述字体风格（衬线/无衬线、手写、哥特式、金属质感等）。\n    *   **属性**：指定颜色、大小、纹理及与背景的融合方式（如雕刻、发光）。\n    *   **布局**：指定具体的相对位置（顶部居中、底部、左下角、跟随曲线排列等）。\n\n### Dimension 5: Layout (整体布局)\n*   **目标**：引导视觉流向。\n*   **要求**：放弃像素级坐标，转而描述构图逻辑。说明元素之间的层级关系（前景/背景）、堆叠方式以及如何引导观众视线聚焦于核心主体。\n\n## 3. 严格约束 (Strict Constraints)\n1.  **语言限制**：**最终输出必须仅为纯正的英文**。\n2.  **格式清洗**：输出结果中**不包含**任何解释性文字、前言、后记或Markdown代码块标记（如 ```json），仅返回纯文本提示词段落。\n3.  **逻辑连贯**：每个维度的描述必须是连贯的句子，而非简单的关键词堆砌\n\n***\n\n**User Input:保时捷海报，香车美女，优雅，高贵，宁静**\n\n\n", 1024, true, 357349476284313, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 172, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 92, "type": "AILab_QwenVL", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name f